---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../config';
---

<Base title="Privacy Policy" description="How the site handles your data — GDPR-compliant, transparent, and easy to understand.">
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-12 text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
    <h1 class="font-display text-3xl font-extrabold text-white">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-500">Last updated: {new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-GB')}</p>

    <p class="mt-6">
      {SITE.name} respects your privacy and is committed to protecting your personal data. This policy
      explains what data we collect, how we use it, and your rights under the EU General Data Protection
      Regulation (GDPR).
    </p>

    <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-white mt-8 mb-3">1. Who we are</h2>
    <p>
      {SITE.name} ({SITE.domain}) is an independent sports analytics and content platform. We do not
      accept bets. We publish free predictions and reviews. For privacy-related questions, contact
      <a class="text-brand-400 underline" href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.
    </p>

    <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-white mt-8 mb-3">2. What we collect</h2>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2">
      <li><strong class="text-white">Automatic data</strong>: pages viewed, referrer URL, approximate IP-based location (country/city), device type, browser, timestamp. Collected via our own server logs.</li>
      <li><strong class="text-white">Analytics data</strong>: aggregated visit counts and traffic sources (via Cloudflare Analytics — anonymous, no personal identifiers).</li>
      <li><strong class="text-white">Newsletter data</strong>: email address you submit, plus the date you subscribed. Nothing else. You can unsubscribe from every email.</li>
      <li><strong class="text-white">Contact data</strong>: anything you write in an email to us.</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-400">We do NOT collect: full name, phone number, payment details, government ID, or gambling account balance.</p>

    <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-white mt-8 mb-3">3. Cookies</h2>
    <p>We use a small number of cookies:</p>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5 mt-2">
      <li><strong class="text-white">Essential</strong>: age-verification flag, cookie-consent choice, dark-mode preference. These do not track you.</li>
      <li><strong class="text-white">Analytics (with your consent)</strong>: Cloudflare aggregated visitor counts. No personal data.</li>
      <li><strong class="text-white">Affiliate referral (with your consent)</strong>: when you click through to a bookmaker, that operator may set its own cookie to attribute your visit. This is done by the operator, not us.</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="mt-3">You choose your cookie preferences on your first visit. You can change your choice any time by clearing your browser data for our domain.</p>

    <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-white mt-8 mb-3">4. How we use data</h2>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5">
      <li>To show you the site and remember your preferences.</li>
      <li>To understand which content is useful (aggregated, never per-user).</li>
      <li>To send the newsletter, if you signed up.</li>
      <li>To respond to your emails.</li>
      <li>To report affiliate revenue with the operators we link to.</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="mt-3">Legal basis: legitimate interest (running the site) and consent (analytics, affiliate, newsletter).</p>

    <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-white mt-8 mb-3">5. Sharing</h2>
    <p>We do NOT sell your data. We share it only with:</p>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5 mt-2">
      <li><strong class="text-white">Cloudflare</strong> — hosting and CDN provider (data centre in EU).</li>
      <li><strong class="text-white">Newsletter provider</strong> (Mailchimp / SendGrid) — only if you subscribe.</li>
      <li><strong class="text-white">Bookmakers</strong> — only via your own click on an affiliate link, and only what your browser sends the operator directly.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-white mt-8 mb-3">6. Retention</h2>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5">
      <li>Server logs: 30 days.</li>
      <li>Aggregated analytics: 12 months.</li>
      <li>Newsletter emails: until you unsubscribe.</li>
      <li>Contact emails: 2 years then deleted.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-white mt-8 mb-3">7. Your rights (GDPR)</h2>
    <p>You have the right to:</p>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5 mt-2">
      <li><strong class="text-white">Access</strong> — request a copy of the data we hold about you.</li>
      <li><strong class="text-white">Rectify</strong> — correct wrong data.</li>
      <li><strong class="text-white">Erase</strong> — ask us to delete it ("right to be forgotten").</li>
      <li><strong class="text-white">Restrict</strong> — limit how we use it.</li>
      <li><strong class="text-white">Object</strong> — opt out of any processing.</li>
      <li><strong class="text-white">Portability</strong> — receive your data in a machine-readable format.</li>
      <li><strong class="text-white">Complain</strong> — to your national data-protection authority. For Cyprus visitors: <a class="text-brand-400 underline" href="https://www.dataprotection.gov.cy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Office of the Commissioner for Personal Data Protection</a>.</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="mt-3">To exercise any right, email <a class="text-brand-400 underline" href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>. We respond within 30 days.</p>

    <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-white mt-8 mb-3">8. Security</h2>
    <p>
      All traffic is HTTPS. We store no passwords or payment data. Server access is limited to authorised
      personnel. In the unlikely event of a breach affecting your data, we will notify you and the
      relevant authority within 72 hours as required by GDPR.
    </p>

    <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-white mt-8 mb-3">9. Children</h2>
    <p>
      {SITE.name} is intended for adults aged {SITE.minAge} and over. We do not knowingly collect data from
      minors. If you believe we have data about a minor, contact us and we will delete it immediately.
    </p>

    <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-white mt-8 mb-3">10. Changes</h2>
    <p>
      We may update this policy. Material changes will be announced on this page and, for newsletter
      subscribers, by email. The "Last updated" date at the top always shows the current version.
    </p>

    <p class="mt-8 text-sm text-slate-500">
      Questions? Email <a class="text-brand-400 underline" href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.
    </p>
  </section>
</Base>
